OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Manx avian flu case recorded
OL,4,Asince 2022
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn outbreak of avian influenza has been
OL,7,Fconfirmed on Isle of Man.
OL,9,FIn the first cases in kept poultry
OL,10,Fsince 2022, two geese and one chicken
OL,11,Ffrom a "backyard flock" in Braddan died
OL,12,Ffrom the H5N1 strain, the Department of
OL,13,FEnvironment, Food and Agriculture
OL,14,F(Defa) said.
OL,16,FChief veterinary officer Dr Amy Beckett
OL,17,Fsaid the risk to human's was low, but
OL,18,Fpeople should avoid touching dead to
OL,19,Fsick birds to avoid further spread of
OL,20,Fthe virus.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
