OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Manx avian flu case recorded
OL,4,Asince 2022
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn all-island avian influenza
OL,7,Fprevention zone has been put in place,
OL,8,Fwith additional restrictions placed
OL,9,Fwithin control zone of 0.62 miles (1km)
OL,10,Faround the affected area.
